# Kamailio dispatcher set file — mirrors OpenSIPS dispatcher.list exactly.
# IMPORTANT: Keep this file in sync with telephony/opensips/conf/dispatcher.list
# so that calls behave identically regardless of which SBC is active.
#
# Format: <setid> <destination> <flags> <priority> <weight>
#
# Sets 1 and 2 are Asterisk-only for the inbound canary.  Asterisk failure
# must surface as a SIP failure, not silently exercise a second runtime whose
# admission, persistence, recording, and settlement paths are not in scope.

# setid  destination              flags  priority  weight
1 sip:127.0.0.1:5070 0 0 100   # Asterisk   (primary)
2 sip:127.0.0.1:5070 0 0 100   # Canary: stable mirror (Asterisk)
